/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 71 0 R
/E (This problem is well suited to the Constraint Satisfaction Problem \(CSP\) model. Each empty cell acts as a variable, its possible symbols form its domain, and the row and column uniqueness rules form the constraints. A decision in one cell can restrict the available choices in other cells, so search and constraint reasoning must work together.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
